# .env AND its backups. A rails edit on 2026-09-01 wrote .env.bak.083709 —
# three secret lines, untracked and NOT ignored, which escaped the EOD
# auto-commit only because its filename lacked that day's date. Coincidence
# is not a control.
.env
.env.*

